        },
        {
          "name": "Blend Mask Name",
          "type": "Name"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FLayeredBoneBlendReference",
      "docs": "Sets the currently-used blend mask for a blended input pose by name.\n@param\tUpdateContext\t\tThe update context to use. This is used to extract the current skeleton to derive the blend mask from\n@param\tLayeredBoneBlend\tA reference to the node\n@param\tPoseIndex\t\t\tThe pose index to set the blend mask for\n@param\tBlendMaskName\tThe name of the blend mask to use"
